{"seq":1,"slug":"compound-interest","title":"复利效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/personal-finance/retirement-planning/compound-interest","wordCount":1418,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"复利效应\">复利效应</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>复利是&quot;世界第八大奇迹&quot;——爱因斯坦如此评价。复利效应的本质是<strong>收益产生收益</strong>：你的投资不仅本金在增长，之前的收益也会继续产生新的收益，形成指数级增长。对程序员来说，复利就像递归函数——每一层调用的结果都会作为下一层的输入，最终产生远超直觉预期的输出。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[初始本金] --&gt; B[第1年收益]&#10;    B --&gt; C[本金+收益]&#10;    C --&gt; D[第2年收益更多]&#10;    D --&gt; E[本金+累计收益]&#10;    E --&gt; F[第3年收益更更多]&#10;    F --&gt; G[...]&#10;    G --&gt; H[指数增长]\">flowchart LR\n    A[初始本金] --&gt; B[第1年收益]\n    B --&gt; C[本金+收益]\n    C --&gt; D[第2年收益更多]\n    D --&gt; E[本金+累计收益]\n    E --&gt; F[第3年收益更更多]\n    F --&gt; G[...]\n    G --&gt; H[指数增长]</pre><p>复利与单利的核心区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>单利</th>\n<th>复利</th>\n<th>差异来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计算方式</td>\n<td>只对本金计息</td>\n<td>对本金+累计利息计息</td>\n<td>利息是否产生利息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增长模式</td>\n<td>线性增长</td>\n<td>指数增长</td>\n<td>增长率恒定 vs 增长基数增大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短期差异</td>\n<td>几乎无差别</td>\n<td>几乎无差别</td>\n<td>时间太短，差异不明显</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期差异</td>\n<td>差异巨大</td>\n<td>差异巨大</td>\n<td>时间越长，复利优势越大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10年(8%利率)</td>\n<td>本金 × 1.8</td>\n<td>本金 × 2.16</td>\n<td>差距 20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30年(8%利率)</td>\n<td>本金 × 3.4</td>\n<td>本金 × 10.06</td>\n<td>差距 196%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解复利效应的关键不在于公式本身，而在于直觉性地认识到<strong>时间是复利最重要的变量</strong>。同样的年化收益率，投资 30 年的结果是投资 10 年的数倍，而非 3 倍。这就是为什么越早开始投资越好——哪怕金额很小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复利公式与计算\">复利公式与计算</h2><p>复利的数学基础简单而优雅。核心公式是 FV = PV × (1 + r)^n，其中 FV 是终值、PV 是现值、r 是收益率、n 是期数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CompoundInterestParams {&#10;  principal: number;&#10;  annualRate: number;&#10;  years: number;&#10;  compoundingFrequency: &#39;annually&#39; | &#39;monthly&#39; | &#39;daily&#39;;&#10;  monthlyContribution?: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function calculateCompoundInterest(params: CompoundInterestParams): {&#10;  finalValue: number;&#10;  totalContributed: number;&#10;  totalInterest: number;&#10;  effectiveAnnualRate: number;&#10;  yearlyBreakdown: { year: number; balance: number; yearInterest: number }[];&#10;} {&#10;  const { principal, annualRate, years, compoundingFrequency, monthlyContribution = 0 } = params;&#10;&#10;  const frequencyMap = { annually: 1, monthly: 12, daily: 365 };&#10;  const n = frequencyMap[compoundingFrequency];&#10;  const ratePerPeriod = annualRate / n;&#10;  const totalPeriods = n * years;&#10;&#10;  let balance = principal;&#10;  const yearlyBreakdown: { year: number; balance: number; yearInterest: number }[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (let year = 1; year &lt;= years; year++) {&#10;    const yearStart = balance;&#10;    for (let period = 0; period &lt; n; period++) {&#10;      balance = balance * (1 + ratePerPeriod) + monthlyContribution * (12 / n);&#10;    }&#10;    yearlyBreakdown.push({&#10;      year,&#10;      balance: Math.round(balance),&#10;      yearInterest: Math.round(balance - yearStart - monthlyContribution * 12),&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const totalContributed = principal + monthlyContribution * 12 * years;&#10;  const effectiveAnnualRate = Math.pow(1 + annualRate / n, n) - 1;&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    finalValue: Math.round(balance),&#10;    totalContributed,&#10;    totalInterest: Math.round(balance - totalContributed),&#10;    effectiveAnnualRate,&#10;    yearlyBreakdown,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompoundInterestParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  principal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  annualRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  years</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  compoundingFrequency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'annually'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'monthly'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'daily'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  monthlyContribution</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateCompoundInterest</span><span style=\"color: